$ python3 -c "
import math, re
total = 0
for line in open(\"$HOME/traffic.out\"):
    sent = int(re.search(r\"(\d+) requests\", line).group(1))
    n = next(n for n in range(1, 5000) if 4*n + 3*math.ceil(n/10) == sent)   # rounds of the worker loop
    total += math.ceil(n/10)                                                # one listing every 10 rounds
print(\"listings created by traffic.sh:\", total)"
listings created by traffic.sh: 407

